        "name": "Ravenous Flock",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Swain's ravens collect <i>Soul Fragments</i> that heal him and permanently increase his maximum health.",
        "bodyHtml": "<br /><br /><span>Ravenous Flock</span><span><font color='#FF9900' size='18'>Ravenous:</span> Swain can right-click an immobilized enemy champion to pull them towards him, ripping out a <font color='#FF3F3F' size='18'>Soul Fragment</span> and dealing <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">?</span> <span style=\"color: #99FF99\">( + ?)</span> magic damage (<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">?</span> second cooldown).<br /><br /><font color='#FF9900' size='18'>Flock:</span> Enemy champion deaths release a <font color='#FF3F3F' size='18'>Soul Fragment</span> that Swain can collect to restore <span style=\"color: #CC3300\">?</span> health. Collecting a <font color='#FF3F3F' size='18'>Soul Fragment</span> permanently increases Swain's maximum health by 5.</span>",
